  "sourceQuote": "(1) $\\overline{AH} \\perp \\overline{BC}$이므로 직각삼각형 $ABH$에서 $\\angle AHB = 90^\\circ$, $\\angle ABH = 45^\\circ$이다. $$\\angle BAH = 90^\\circ - 45^\\circ = 45^\\circ$$ (2) $\\angle BAC = 75^\\circ$이므로 $$\\angle CAH = \\angle BAC - \\angle BAH = 75^\\circ - 45^\\circ = 30^\\circ$$ (3) 직각삼각형 $ACH$에서 $\\overline{AC} = 10\\text{ m}$, $\\angle CAH = 30^\\circ$이므로 $$\\overline{AH} = \\overline{AC} \\cos 30^\\circ = 10 \\times \\dfrac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} = 5\\sqrt{3}\\text{ m}$$ (4) 직각삼각형 $ABH$는 $\\angle ABH = \\angle BAH = 45^\\circ$인 직각이등변삼각형이므로 $$\\overline{AB} = \\dfrac{\\overline{AH}}{\\sin 45^\\circ} = 5\\sqrt{3} \\div \\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} = 5\\sqrt{6}\\text{ m}$$"
